ttp://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7916453128576207383/comments/default/1296631449876666308'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7916453128576207383/comments/default/1296631449876666308'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/06/tumult-and-blood.html?showComment=1212811860000#c1296631449876666308' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2008/06/tumult-and-blood.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7916453128576207383' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/7916453128576207383' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="June 6, 2008 at 10:11 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8746048885286133578</id><published>2008-06-06T08:43:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-06-06T08:43:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Check out today&#39;s new article on gritsforbreakfast...</title><content type='html'>Check out today&#39;s new article on gritsforbreakfast blogspot.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&quot;Most recently, an informant in Plano who threatened to out police officers in five Metroplex departments was found shot to death in his home this morning, making him the second steroid dealer/informant killed this year before he could testify against law enforcement. Reported Jason Trahan at the Dallas News (&quot;Convicted steroid dealer David Jacobs found dead in Plano home,&quot; June 5)&quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/7916453128576207383/comments/default/874604888528